[Mission.Objectives]
Americans are on their way from the direction of point 2, attack them before they reach us! Let me remind you once again - make the terrain your powerful ally! Good luck!
[Mission.Success]
Evacuation has been successfully completed!
[Mission.Failed]
All “Tigers” are taken down or destroyed, the enemy breached through to the village before the evacuation was over. The mission has failed!

[Mission.Description]
[StringTable.FirstWaveDefeated]
The first enemy attack broke down, but they are engaging their reserves from point 3. Hold on!
[StringTable.IntroSubtitle1]
Major Gerhard in his “Kübelwagen” to the commanders of the “Tigers”:
[StringTable.IntroSubtitle2]
The enemy is very strong, but...
[StringTable.IntroSubtitle3]
let me remind you once again, that ...
[StringTable.IntroSubtitle4]
The Tiger is almost invulnerable to long-distance attacks.
[StringTable.IntroSubtitle5]
The terrain allows us to fire from a long distance, ...
[StringTable.IntroSubtitle6]
this should become our trump card.
[StringTable.InfoSubtitle7]
Good luck, Herr Ofiziere! Advance! Gott mit uns!
[StringTable.InfoSubtitle8]
“Tiger” commanders: Zu Befehl!
[StringTable.IntroSubtitle7]
[StringTable.SubtitleWin1]
Major Gerhard: They succeeded! However, I didn’t expect anything short of that.
[StringTable.SubtitleWin2]
Herren Ofiziere, I congratulate you on the victory!
[StringTable.SubtitleWin3]
Though I can’t let you enjoy your well-earned rest.
[StringTable.SubtitleWin4]
While our attention was drawn...
[StringTable.SubtitleWin5]
by the Americans, the British outflanked us.
[StringTable.SubtitleWin6]
You must counterattack them immediately.
[StringTable.SubtitleWin7]
The fate of the Reich is in our hands once again!
[StringTable.SubtitleWin8]
“Tiger” crew: Zu Befehl!
[StringTable.SubtitleFail1]
Ally tank radios: Take no prisoners! Kill'em all!
[StringTable.SubtitleFail2]
You slaughtered my buddy Jimmy! Die, f*** bastard!
[StringTable.SubtitleFail3]
No mercy to the bastards! Crush them!
[StringTable.SubtitleFail4]
Watch'em burn!
